OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters complete 9/11
OL,4,Amemorial stair climb in US
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of firefighters from Lancashire
OL,7,Fand Greater Manchester have completed a
OL,8,Fmemorial stair climb in the United
OL,9,FStates to honour colleagues who died in
OL,10,Fthe 11 September attacks.
OL,12,FThe firefighters travelled to Atlanta,
OL,13,FGeorgia, where they joined around 200
OL,14,Ffirefighters from across the UK and
OL,15,FIreland for the challenge.
OL,17,FParticipants climbed the equivalent of
OL,18,F110 floors, matching the height of the
OL,19,FWorld Trade Center towers in New York,
OL,20,Fwhere 343 firefighters were among those
OL,21,Fkilled during the attacks in 2001.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
